Feigl - I'm going to assume this is the name - JS. I think his original name
was Conrad Kurt Feigl but he eventually became Charles Feigl and then Charles
Kenneth Field. Team results: G Jessup ½, T Landry ½, L Rosselson 0, N Dor ½,
G Dunkley 0, F Newman 0. 1½-4½ v Finchley.} 1-0

