scoresheet. Undated. N.B. "Cuppers" in the 1970s was the name given to the
Cambridge University Chess Club's Inter-College KO team competition rather
than the Inter-College League; in the 1950s it may have referred to the
Inter-College League. Note also that what is now Fitzwilliam College,
Cambridge, was known as Fitzwilliam House at this time.} 0-1

